# Conformance probe pack for spec 0.94: keys bound by `when ... as`, in the common lines and in a kind. Public.
format     conformance-held-as
version    0.94.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
when    8  5,6  as probe.w
kind    a
when    8  1..3  as probe.x
field   probe.y  8  uint
kind    b
when    8  9
field   probe.z  8  uint
